# NewUnera — Inline icon + text rows (`.unera-icon-lead`)

Use this pattern when a **paragraph or callout** starts with a **Material Symbols** inline SVG (`viewBox="0 -960 960 960"`) followed by running text, and **baseline alignment** looks wrong or fragile (typical for 20px icons next to 0.875rem–1rem copy).

**Not** for:

- **`.input-hint`** rows that already use the global `.input-hint > svg:first-child { vertical-align: -0.18em; }` nudge — keep those unless you intentionally stack `.input-hint.unera-icon-lead` (then flex overrides apply; see §3).
- **Centered** success follow-up under `.success-screen` — use **`input-hint--success-followup`** (see `.cursor/rules/newunera-success-screen-hero.mdc` §2a).
- **`ul/li`** rows that already define their own `display: flex` + icon rules (e.g. `.info-box li`).

## 1. DOM

```html
<p class="unera-icon-lead unera-icon-lead--sm">
  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">…</svg>
  <span>Body copy and <strong>emphasis</strong>.</span>
</p>
```

- **Order:** `svg` first, then **`<span>`** wrapping all text so the flex row has two clear children.
- **Do not** leave a stray emoji or variation selector after `</svg>` (breaks layout and a11y).
- **Do not** put the SVG inside `<strong>`; keep emphasis inside the `<span>`.

## 2. CSS (per `NewUnera/*.html` page styles)

Copy the block from **`exchange.html`** / **`send-enhanced.html`** (classes `unera-icon-lead`, modifiers below). Core rules:

| Rule | Role |
|------|------|
| `.unera-icon-lead` | `display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; margin: 0;` |
| `.unera-icon-lead > span` | `min-width: 0; flex: 1 1 auto;` (wrap in narrow viewports) |
| `.unera-icon-lead > svg:first-child` | `flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.1em;` (first-line optical alignment) |

**Modifiers** (examples used in product HTML):

| Class | Role |
|-------|------|
| `.unera-icon-lead--sm` | `font-size: 0.875rem` |
| `.unera-icon-lead--text-base` | `font-size: var(--text-base)` |
| `.unera-icon-lead--tone-error` | `color: var(--error)` |
| `.unera-icon-lead--tone-success` | `color: var(--success)` |
| `.unera-icon-lead--mt-half` | `margin-top: 0.5rem` (stacked under a previous row) |

**Compound (optional):**

```css
.input-hint.unera-icon-lead > svg:first-child {
  margin-right: 0;
  vertical-align: unset;
}
```

